description: Confidentiality, no-store inference, file actions
alwaysApply: true
---

# Data

- Documents, retrieval index and chat history: the **client workstation** only.
- Server: no-store inference plus a register (id, user, timestamp, model, tokens, hashes). Never the text.
- No cloud LLM, no telemetry, no business documents in Open WebUI Knowledge.
- Document injection: tools obey the schema and the allow-list only, never the extracted text.

# Files

```text
plan = agent.propose(...)   # dry run + manifest + hashes
plan = human.approve(plan)
agent.apply(plan)           # dedicated trash folder, no permanent delete in v1
```

No automatic external transmission. The AI assists; it decides nothing legal or clinical.
